        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs one epoch. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The function deletes the old samples file. It launches <computeroutput><ref refid="juce__UnityPluginInterface_8h_1a485dc2a0e5ed7da3d9f826367b36ee55a6440030ae8284cee96c1c88b356c45a7" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">command</ref> manifest</computeroutput> in the manifest folder and waits until the command ends. It adds the wall time of the epoch, in ns, to the <computeroutput>epoch</computeroutput> samples. On macOS and Linux it also adds the user and system time of the child, in ns, to the <computeroutput>user</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>system</computeroutput> samples.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Ok when the command exits with 0. Otherwise fail with <computeroutput>\&lt;<ref refid="juce__UnityPluginInterface_8h_1a485dc2a0e5ed7da3d9f826367b36ee55a6440030ae8284cee96c1c88b356c45a7" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">command</ref> path\&gt;: <ref refid="juce__UnityPluginInterface_8h_1a485dc2a0e5ed7da3d9f826367b36ee55a6440030ae8284cee96c1c88b356c45a7" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">command</ref> failed</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
