<para>The function parses the file. Each table except <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> adds its rows with <computeroutput><ref refid="class_benchmark_1a9b9d076f0ec7ea35ca1cb50a2d280f29" kindref="member">addRows</ref></computeroutput>. The type of the last such table becomes the profile type. The <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> table is kept for the report. Every row holds one sample for each epoch. A row that the file does not hold adds 0 for this epoch. A new row starts with 0 for each earlier epoch.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Ok when the file exists. Otherwise fail with <computeroutput>not found: \&lt;samples path\&gt;</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
